{"id":"660982","name":"酱肉蒸毛豆","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660982/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"毛豆","amount":"420克"},{"name":"酱肉","amount":"115克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：毛豆、酱肉（已清洗）。","img":"images/660982/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将毛豆剥壳淘洗干净。","img":"images/660982/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将酱肉放在案板上切成片。","img":"images/660982/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将毛豆放入盘中、加适量的盐。","img":"images/660982/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"调味拌匀。","img":"images/660982/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"接着，合入切好的酱肉。","img":"images/660982/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，放入蒸锅里。","img":"images/660982/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上盖，开锅隔水蒸15分钟即可。","img":"images/660982/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}